## Interface: 16001
## Title: MysteriousQoL
## Notes: Mysterious quality of life improvements
## Version: 1.5.3
## SavedVariables: MysteriousQoLDB
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\MysteriousQoL\MysteriousQoL

# WoW: Forever. The _Camelot suffix is the client's internal flavor name, the same
# way retail uses _Mainline -naming this file _Forever would not be picked up.
#
# Anything that matches on retail spell IDs is left out until those are redone
# against Forever's spell data: Blink, Stealth, Zoomies, and every reminder except
# Mail and Repair. Buff Reminder loads only for its seal option. Ready Check is out
# too -its durability, weapon buff, Well Fed and Healthstone checks all assume
# retail consumables. Skip Queue Confirm is out
# because Classic has no group finder sign-up dialog to auto-click.

